            <ArticleTitle>2012 Update in addiction medicine for the generalist.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1186/1940-0640-8-6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents an update on addiction-related medical literature for the calendar years 2010 and 2011, focusing on studies that have implications for generalist practice. We present articles pertaining to medical comorbidities and complications, prescription drug misuse among patients with chronic pain, screening and brief interventions (SBIs), and pharmacotherapy for addiction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
